      "t": "At the apartment, Max bolts upright from a nightmare about being caught between Vika and Sasha and wakes Kostya and Nastya in the middle of the night. The next day at Claude Monet, a fussy guest sends back a plate of raw steak tartare and demands that the kitchen fry it.",
